    "verdict_notes": "The abstract mentions 'representation similarity across architectures' only as motivation; no cross-model experiment is run. The classifier–feature and commutator results (Tables 1, E.1–E.4) are rightly left out of rows, since they are within-network constructs. Rows R01–R33 are within-model head overlaps, correctly linked to none."
